{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>With a fist</b> — bet [is the prefix] in the phrase <b>במסה</b> דין [meaning: in a quarrel], and the other [instance]: <b>ולהכות באגרוף</b> (Numbers 35:21). 'Wicked' — because they imprison him, for if the struck man dies they execute him; therefore the blow must be sufficient to kill, which is <b>באגרוף רשע</b>, for he struck with force."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:54.135718669Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}